'''Dragon Armor''' is a set of {{Legendary}} [[Armor]] sets that are obtained from defeating their respective {{MobSprite|Ender Dragon}} or by crafting them with their respective [[Dragon Fragment]]s. Each set of '''Dragon Armor''' has a full set bonus that corresponds to its purpose.

All sets of '''Dragon Armor''', with the exception of {{Item|Superior Dragon Armor}}, require {{Skl|Combat 16}} to use. {{Item|Superior Dragon Armor}} requires {{Skl|Combat 20}} instead.

