}}{{BazaarInfoIcon}} from fragments from the bazaar. Most of the total coins come from the cost of the raw materials for {{Item|Superior Dragon Armor}}.

*{{Item|Holy Dragon Armor}} is the only set of Dragon Armor which does not drop from an {{MobSprite|Ender Dragon}}, as there are no Holy Dragons. Instead, they are dropped from {{MobSprite|Lost Adventurer}}s wearing Holy Dragon Armor in the [[Catacombs]].

